  "description": "Hara meets a beautiful girl at a club one night, and goes home with her. After a sweet rendezvous, Go-Eun wakes the next morning to find Hara in her bed. Shocked, she kicks Hara out, because she has no recollection of sleeping with her. So who was Hara sleeping with? A story about Hara, Go-Eun and another ‘Go-Eun’!\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
